{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Continental Congress","id":"875137859592531978","name":"liberty-hall","position":39,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I cannot speak to other powers but the pact I keep with the ravens says that I be their hand in what is to come. A hand, not a mouth, not a mind. I will stay here and listen, on their behalf. I will speak, on my behalf in line with theirs. Maybe the gods and the wardens have a plan for this world that we know nothing about, but I will not agree to abandoning the power of our choices to let Arcania become a victim of divine circumstance.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:00:08.616000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:01:59.073000Z","id":"875559318416658483","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica nods to Irynx \"Well said. We must keep our agency, not abandon it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:01:12.368000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875559585811935292","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Finn nods in agreement","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:03:51.307000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875560252450406410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Choosing is better than not choosing. It's how I've always lived and I want Arcania to the same.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:04:17.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875560362290868274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I was once foolish enough to think myself capable of fighting against beings akin to gods. I am proposing to incorporate them in our nation and listen to them in fear that they would force themselves into the narrative. The only being capable of going against gods are themselves. I say again, we need all the help we can get. The mender brings up a good point in us being more creative in using the arcane.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:05:32.437000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875560676620382248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Does your campaign have anything to do with Nidhogg, Speaker? He is a demigod, a powerful one. Is there a motive here?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:06:43.809000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:08:26.979000Z","id":"875560975976259595","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Actually, don't answer. I know it hurts you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:08:37.234000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875561451715194922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"To separate them is important. Gods do not lead our actions, at least not everyone's collectively. They should be respected but not as leaders. Even Washington himself has said 'Influence is no government.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:08:44.689000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:08:54.505000Z","id":"875561482983735355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I do not come here to represent, merely to warn everyone here that we should not, and cannot, easily discount higher powers. No matter how hard we declare seperation, powerful beings can easily just overcome that. Let us work with them, wardens, demigods, or ravens.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:09:16.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875561615414681671","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"To work with them doesn't mean we allow them in spaces where our agency and the agency of the people are most important.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:10:17.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875561873196613713","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The white raven nods at Vivica. \"Our leaders should be representative of their people. Maybe there are people who live their lives *chosen* by gods and all-powerful beings, but what about the rest? What about the nobodies and the nothings, the hands that build?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:10:28.423000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875561918075662346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Or simply the ones without magic?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:10:58.635000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562044793946172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"A chosen one does not represent everyone. That's that.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:11:05.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562075546607677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica nods in agreement with Irynx","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:12:22.185000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562395228078130","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Agency? What good is agency compared to convience? Do you want agency to repair your own roads?\" Says a disgruntled halfling.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:12:40.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562471295950920","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The fey in the suit turns his attention to the group. \"What is a god? where is the line drawn? Could i become a legal god by attracting enough people? I agree with the speaker that to ignore them entirely would be faulty, but i think to put them inherently above others is wrong. I am of the belief that we shoudl treat the gods as we treat each other. If they wish to engage in our democracy, they should be subject to the same rules. And if they wish to be aloof and not concerned with matters of state, that is their decision.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:12:48.790000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562506817527900","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Is it not a quantifiable measure of success to have achieved godhood? Surely they would be better leaders than mortals.\"says Cassie, the old lady.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:14:01.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562812657786990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Isn't there a thing Paladins can do to detect the divine?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:14:05.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875562827765678110","reply_to_id":"875562506817527900","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"What's better in a leader? Their ability to represent or their competence? A leader who looks and speaks nothing like me but is capable of handling affairs of state is someone I'll stand with.\" The speaker replies to Irynx, before turning towards Vivica.\n\"Do you value agency over safety? What if higher beings come to forcefully integrate with us, what then? The fine madam speaks wisely. We cannot and should not discount higher beings.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:14:51.652000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563022138105909","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Paladins can detect the nature of a being, not their power. To a holy warrior's senses, a god would register the same as an angel. And a god belonging to the lower planes would be different than a god of the upper planes. There is no good metric.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:15:23.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563157110808627","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Or agency to remove the city's sewage?\" Cassie continues. \"I don't want to schlep my poop around, too much agency is awful. People don't know everything, or even much of anything. You are lucky if you are skilled at one thing.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:15:45.279000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563247066046516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica shakes her head \"This conversation will only go in circles. You ask these questions as if they are mutually exclusive. They aren't. \" she says to Speaker","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:15:47.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563255320420394","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Frankly, all sentients are not equal. They deserve an equal oppertunity sure, but they aren't just given the same result.\" Says the Minotaur.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:17:12.302000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563612066963486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"But where is that line between god and demigod, demigod and powerful extraplanar being?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:17:21.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563651006857276","reply_to_id":"875562812657786990","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"My point is that too many semantics will lead us to a place no one is happy with.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:18:27.525000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875563927575085076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Every level can be denied. Exarchs can choose not to become gods. And the one who choose it to be so offered is beyond mortal comprehension.\" She has a wicked gleam in her eye. <@!260820438026813440>","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:18:28.199000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:18:54.857000Z","id":"875563930402041896","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"While I do not agree with all the Minotaur speaks, they bring a good point. No matter how strong our ideals are, there are countless inequalities amongst the beings of this world. We should plan our governments accordingly. Declaring all of us to be equal is both wrong and foolish.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:19:06.721000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:20:15.127000Z","id":"875564091975032882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Learn to hold your heads higher. If divine powers wish to engage in Arcania, they will do so under our rules. We should have power too. That's how you survive when you're not chosen, when you don't have royal blood in your veins or powers handed by the divine. When the world gives us nothing, then we should pick up and demand something for us all.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:20:16.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875564383441416223","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"And under what power of yours will the divines follow? How do you wish to enforce your laws on them?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:20:55.494000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875564548202037290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I'm not here to debate to gods. Should they be respected? Sure but I can name only the Ravens as a higher being that as hepled me in my life however the list of people I can name is countless. What is so wrong to let the people choose our leader in a fair election? The gods may have their influence on the land but they don't have it on every person here and beyond these doors. This conversation has only been going in circles with nothing actually being accomplished. To debate the gods and their philosophy is not the goal here, it is to build a government.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:21:17.888000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:22:20.431000Z","id":"875564642129301535","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Does not everyone have the same opportunity to serve? Everyone has the same opportunity to commune with greater powers. Not everyone chooses to do so.\" <@!366565198284324868>","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:21:25.550000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875564674266066955","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The fey looks to the woman before blinking, his eyes turning a bright white. They fade back to normal and he nods slowly before looking at the others.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:21:39.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875564732629807104","reply_to_id":"875563930402041896","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Choice. Exactly! Choice!\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:21:45.649000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875564758567358484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Choose to be a part of the civilized magic weilding world. Or choose a harder life. Thats freedom for you. Freedom to fail is still freedom.\" Says the Railroad Baron.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:22:42.677000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:23:02.828000Z","id":"875564997760135239","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"In face of greater beings, mortals like us might not have a choice anymore. I am proposing to incorporate gods into our government, because I think they will be an inescapable inevitability. Declaring seperation from the divine is one thing, actually implementing and enforcing it is another.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:23:23.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565166945771531","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The fey nods to Vivica. \"Agreed.\" He falls silent, somewhat in contemplation","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:23:59.772000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565321119997962","reply_to_id":"875564642129301535","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Its not like people will abandon the gods. People will follow and serve any god they choose.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:25:01.005000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565577949806602","reply_to_id":"875565166945771531","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"The Old Gods are facing a war today. Clearly, there's some disagreement in divine ranks. Will you choose which gods to incorporate in the government, or will Arcania be born on all kinds of war?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:25:01.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565581007487067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Lucy flies over apearing angry at Speaker. \"And who would you not consider equal? What beings wouldnt be considered equal?\" Bo's voice echoes through her, agitated.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:25:28.068000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565691460255765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"kerry the mail carrier chimes. \"do gods get a vote?","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:25:52.027000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565791951589446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Choose not the Gods of the Old world. That is like worshiping a plate of old spagetti. Useless. The wardens protect us from them.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:26:24.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875565926639083520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Old spaghetti won't even stick to a wall.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:26:53.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875566051268644865","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Lucy beams a light down onto Speaker, like an interogation light. \"Who... Isn't... Equal?\" Bo's voice asks again.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:27:20.129000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:29:53.660000Z","id":"875566161478172742","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"With exceptions such as Anansi, Web, Davy, and Mello, The powers who are not wardens are few and far between.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:27:38.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875566238955339787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"If they choose to follow our laws, and act as a citizen sure. But will a god do such a thing? Will they be bound by our material rules of life?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:27:47.661000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875566276955762708","reply_to_id":"875565791951589446","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Vivica sits back frustrated \"I don't concern myself with the gods for this exact reason.\" She says mostly to herself","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:31:54.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875567312793645087","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Lucy continues to hover, glaring at Speaker.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:32:23.672000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875567434629795851","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"You should be concerned, gods are powerful forces in this world. You don't need to believe in their causes to see they indeed hold power.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:33:19.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875567669779247194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"They have done nothing for me. I concern myself with people.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:34:44.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875568027242987521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"You know what, we worry so much for rights, divine or not, let's discuss responsibilities. What *should* we expect from a citizen of Arcania?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:35:09.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875568131240763402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"kerry chirps \"but there's a lot of stories about mortals who act almost as the same level. if mortals can challenge the gods isn't it fair to have society without their authority?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:35:12.759000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:36:09.765000Z","id":"875568143832076298","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"You said nothing of the gods... Ya done did say...'Declaring all of us to be equal is both wrong and foolish.' ....you said, all of *us* .... So, by the by... Who?!?!\" Bo asks.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:35:17.091000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875568162001784852","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Lucy appears to be extremely agitated.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:36:25.144000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875568447436771388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Me and Finn have created a list of basic rights for the people\" she gestures to the documen they've passed \"I would like to hear your thoughts on it\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:36:28.492000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:37:01.648000Z","id":"875568461479309312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Of course more can be added but its to get us started.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:37:20.996000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875568681697030204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"The speaker looks towards Lucy. \"I said my statement with no intention to offend. This world is full of inequalities, you don't need to like it or accept it, but it would be wrong to ignore it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:38:37.651000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569003211407390","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"And it would be right to change it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:38:56.659000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569082936733736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Who ... Is ... Unequal?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:39:00.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569100682829864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"We will not be unequal in the law, right?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:39:32.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569232925061200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"We shouldn't be. That's the goal.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:40:34.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569495228436541","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Everyone gets a vote, a voice, and the same rights as everyone else.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:41:01.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569606138404894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Also, what's the stance on housing? I know a lot of people have a good deal in the Ferrytown parks but is a space of living a privilege?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:41:34.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569743078248460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"People who wield unequal power.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:41:54.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569828482658334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"All beings are equal... Maybe not in their strengths, but in this government... All being should be equal in terms of rights, or punishment.... If you begin to exclude any race from being equal on these lands.... Then your no better than them coats!\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:42:02.345000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875569861760253952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Totally right. No one is above the law.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:43:27.087000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875570217193988146","reply_to_id":"875569861760253952","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"They should be equal in terms of responsibilities, too. We will not just decide what the state must do for the people, but what the people must do for others. A right is not more important than a responsibility.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:43:42.392000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875570281387790396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Haven't considered this. How much should the government interfere with this? If we instate a living wage it would include the price of housing.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:44:13.943000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875570413722304522","reply_to_id":"875569743078248460","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I agree... But the speaker here says that it would be foolish to include all of us\" Lucy continues to glare","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:44:38.072000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875570514926665769","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I want to see a world that gives and people that give back. I want a government that cares, and people that do the same.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:44:48.859000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:45:35.476000Z","id":"875570560170602517","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"I think you will like the section on the justice system. Restorative justice, a system that focuses on community.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:45:06.038000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875570632224555038","reply_to_id":"875570281387790396","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Its just as much building a culture that supports others as much as it can become an expectation by law.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:46:02.683000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875570869810917417","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I said nothing about Inclusion, nor anything about race. I point to the difference in strenght that you have admitted yourself, and ask how we wish to bridge that. Words and declarations are capable of calling people to action but they cannot fight against threats. How do you plan to enforce your laws, especially to those who hold more power than you?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:46:47.448000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:46:54.294000Z","id":"875571057568919593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Enforcement and accountability comes from the judicial branch.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:47:46.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875571306135969822","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"So we are unequal in power, and I speak about responsibilities. I'll say this then, one should give to others within the limits of their resource. If you are one of great power, then you should be expected to give greatly.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:48:15.374000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:48:29.191000Z","id":"875571426357309470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"A woman sipping from an oddly ornate floral themed silver chalice sits with the white leonin, cassie the old woman and the hooded women with the skin that glows like golden flame.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:49:00.919000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875571617386864692","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Its a good standard to hold for people.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:49:04.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875571632981278812","reply_to_id":"875571426357309470","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
