{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"Cassie coughs loudly.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:50:37.712000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875572023366144031","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"I'm not a fan of magic if I'm being all that honest. I expect court rooms to be antimagic fields aside from the use of Zone of Truth, I expect police or Lamplighters to be well trained and not use excessive force. I expect restorative justice practices to prevent repeat offenders.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:52:25.270000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875572474497093642","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"If one wishes so badly not be a part of this society, then they will not be. Refusing your responsibility to uphold the law means refusing the rights that come with being a citizen of Arcania.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:52:55.557000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-13T02:53:27.822000Z","id":"875572601529962566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Aside from the one magic you need. Ha! Hypocrite.\" Says a nameless stranger.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:53:09.614000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875572660489314305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"So you would simply abandon those who break your laws? I hardly think is is a sustainable system.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:53:38.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875572782975557703","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Clearly you don't know what restorative justice is otherwise you wouldn't have said that.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:54:12.825000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875572925615439933","reply_to_id":"875572782975557703","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"The decision to enforce responsability based on one's strength... It aint gonna do nuttin' but segregate the races apart from each other... This 'freedom' will be a pipe dream.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:54:31.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875573002799046726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"No one said anything about breaking laws. Vivica talked about a restorative justice system. I talk about rights and responsibilities.\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:54:33.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875573012454309919","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
