{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"Well. As I remember it. The first king of england, Arthur the once and future king, first gained power when a watery tart began distributing magic swords. Maybe, what we need... Is a like. A lady chinnokin with a cleaver. \" says a loxodon.","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:56:22.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875573469604110426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"875137859592531978","content":"\"You speak of a social contract then? A trade of rights and safeties. But what of beings who need not your society's power and actually has more. What will you do about them?\"","created_at":"2021-08-13T02:57:15.257000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875573690790727720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
